{"t":"Uniwheel","s":"uniwheel-24922","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Uniwheel_c3a036.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"actualname\">Uniwheel</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Uniwheel\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Uniwheel_c3a036.gif\" width=\"64\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"speed\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Speed Bonus</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p>+10 speed</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"taming_method\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Taming method</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Use a <a href=\"#/wiki/Golden%20Can%20of%20Oil\">Golden Can of Oil</a> on a stationary Uniwheel.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"colourisable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Colourisable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"name\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought in<br/>Store</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"achievement\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Achievement</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p>Stuntman</p></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">9.10<br/>July 6, 2011<br/>Summer Update 2011</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Mounts, [1] <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-mount-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>The Uniwheel object is located in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Yielothax%20Dimension\">Yielothax Dimension</a>, accessed during The Mage's Tower world change. It can be found <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32939,31583,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32939, 31583, 9)</a>.\n</p><p>Before Updates/9.2, it wasn't possible to access the room containing the the Uniwheel — due to a map bug, the stairs to the floor it's located didn't exist.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"00adbe91a48a1037d3f980745b569336\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Uniwheel-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:179px;\"><img alt=\"Uniwheel room\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Uniwheel room\" height=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Uniwheel_0712cf.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Uniw